---
alwaysApply: true
---

- Never commit fixtures containing real PII. Before staging anything under `tests/fixtures/`, grep for real names and UPI reference numbers.
- Run `uv run pytest` before proposing a commit. Coverage gate is enforced.
- Run `uv run ruff check src/ tests/` before proposing a commit.
- Run `uv run mypy src/` before proposing a commit.
- When adding a dependency, also run `uv lock` and stage `uv.lock`.
- Logging tracks progress only. Do not narrate every step; tight docstrings plus minimal `logger.info` calls are preferred over verbose logging.
- No emojis in code or documentation.
